 "id": 1856203,
 "titulo": "7/1 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1751353242832,
 "modificada": 1752562934612,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1856203",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1751344990227\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7d0d998e6a114fb989c4eacfc18c3222_1751344990227_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">In this patch, we’re introducing a gifted inventor,<br>\nand a Super Villain who can wield the demon's power.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Ironheart</span>, who uses her engineering talents to create her own suits,<br>\nis getting a <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-4</span> and a <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">New Uniform</span>.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">And <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">The Hood</span>, who has embarked on a life of crime utilizing a mystical hood and boots,<br>\nis ready to enter the world of MARVEL Future Fight with <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-3 </span>abilities.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated heroes<br>\nby downloading the 7/1 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>■ 7/1 Patch Details</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 7/2 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 7/1 (Tue) 20:00 (PDT)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[7/2&nbsp;(Wed) 2:59 (UTC+0), 7/1&nbsp;(Tue) 19:59&nbsp;(PDT) added]</span><br>\nThe patch has been completed as of 7/2&nbsp;(Wed) 2:59 (UTC+0), 7/1&nbsp;(Tue) 19:59 (PDT).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances.</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The patch will be applied in waves, and the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ One New Hero</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the abilities of The Hood &lt;<em>Marvel Television’s Ironheart</em>&gt;,&nbsp;<br>\nwho utilizes a hood infused with demonic powers to fulfill his ambition&nbsp;<br>\nof becoming the leader of all Super Villains.</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects of the new hero are based on the maximum skill level stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1536\" id=\"1751345121729\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/05e3fde4840e45a0bf7525574f877059_1751345121729_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ One New Uniform</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The new Uniform Ironheart &lt;<em>Marvel Television’s Ironheart</em>&gt; has been added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects of the new hero are based on the maximum skill level stats.<br>\n* The one new Uniform</span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"> will be on sale for 40% off during the &lt;Ironheart Update Celebration Event&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">and can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the Event.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1758\" id=\"1751345186860\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7c516dbcc02a49f2a2f441372fb42202_1751345186860_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Ironheart Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The addition of the Tier-4 advancement is one of many ways to prove Ironheart’s genius,<br>\nand her shining abilities will be widely recognized.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The Tier-4 Striker Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"346\" id=\"1751345222868\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6d055cf14bb64acc92e0ceb88d2eee31_1751345222868_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ The Hood Tier-3</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Tier-3 Ultimate skills have been added to The Hood.&nbsp;<br>\nWielding powerful demonic forces, who would dare stop him?</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"390\" id=\"1751345272009\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb6ce5a665ef4ecdbd3479dab65ad8f9_1751345272009_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1751345299608\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/aaeca64df2bc4bf2b43dde0643b12163_1751345299608.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Artifact</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">After the 7/1 patch, Exclusive Passive Skill Artifact for The Hood will be added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">﻿* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"333\" id=\"1751355606957\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/64f34f982e3a4c9c9f414ffa2cb8e7b0_1751355606957_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Some of the&nbsp;Time Attack Special Deals that were previously sold will be available again.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The products will be available to Agents who have not purchased the product before.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Sunspot not being categorized as X-Men in the Team - My Team section has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1751344990220\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f6ffa80eb0ae4876ac6820b444e921fe_1751344990220_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n"
}